-- 10b: a provenance trigger left disabled is reported by check_integrity
ERROR:  sql_saga: integrity violation for era "valid" on table "pv_161.lu": provenance trigger valid_provenance is disabled; repair with ALTER TABLE pv_161.lu ENABLE TRIGGER valid_provenance
-- 11: registration refusals: no DEFAULT; not an ephemeral column; removing a provenance column from ephemeral
 set_era_ephemeral_columns 
---------------------------
 
(1 row)

ERROR:  sql_saga: provenance column "note" of table "pv_161.lu" has no DEFAULT
HINT:  sql_saga fills a provenance column from its DEFAULT. Give it one, e.g. ALTER TABLE pv_161.lu ALTER COLUMN note SET DEFAULT ...
ERROR:  sql_saga: provenance column "name" of table "pv_161.lu" is not an ephemeral column of era "valid"
HINT:  Add it to ephemeral_columns first (set_era_ephemeral_columns): writer and time must not count as a change of data.
ERROR:  sql_saga: column "edit_by" of table "pv_161.lu" is a provenance column of era "valid" and must stay ephemeral
HINT:  Remove it from provenance_columns first (set_era_provenance_columns).
